OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Awife's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA provisional trial date has been set
OL,7,Ffor a man accused of murdering his
OL,8,Fwife.
OL,10,FGeoffrey Billett, 68, was charged with
OL,11,Fthe murder of Jill Billett, 69, after
OL,12,Fshe was found with serious injuries at
OL,13,Fan address on Overnhill Road in
OL,14,FDownend, near Bristol, shortly after
OL,15,F01:45 BST on Sunday. She died in
OL,16,Fhospital a few hours later.
OL,18,FAppearing at Bristol Crown Court
OL,19,Fearlier, a trial date for Billett, who
OL,20,Fis yet to enter a plea, was set for 15
OL,21,FMarch 2027.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
