OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Awife's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe remains in custody after being
OL,7,Frefused bail by the judge and is next
OL,8,Fdue to appear at the same court on 18
OL,9,FNovember.
